XIO OPTIMIZER

The optimizer operates only on validated IR.

INITIAL PASSES
    constant_fold
    constant_propagation
    dead_code_elimination
    dead_block_elimination
    copy_propagation
    algebraic_simplification
    redundant_load_elimination
    redundant_store_elimination
    branch_simplification
    unreachable_elimination
    phi_simplification

ADVANCED PASSES
    inlining
    devirtualization
    loop_invariant_code_motion
    loop_unrolling
    strength_reduction
    common_subexpression_elimination
    global_value_numbering
    scalar_replacement
    tail_call_optimization

RULE
    optimization must preserve observable behavior,
    memory semantics,
    atomic semantics,
    volatile semantics,
    ownership semantics,
    ABI requirements.
